  2026 Oct 22 00:41:33 user.notice awplus IMISH[3404]: [manager@ttyS0]show clock | include CKT33402-PERM-3
  2026 Oct 22 00:44:47 user.notice awplus IMISH[2880]: [manager@ttyS0]show log permanent | include CKT33402-PERM

  All five pre-restart entries are there, with their ORIGINAL timestamps and their
  original PIDs (IMISH[3404], the process of the previous boot -- the current boot's is
